    <!-- ============ SECTION 16 – GLOSSARY ============ -->
    <div class="section-header" id="s16"><span class="num">16</span><h2>Quick-Reference Glossary</h2><span class="line"></span></div>
    <div class="three-col">
      <div class="card cn">
        <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Investment property</div><div class="glossary-def">Property held to earn rentals or for capital appreciation, rather than for use in operations or for sale.</div></div>
        <div class="glossary-item" style="border-bottom:none;"><div class="glossary-term">Owner-occupied property</div><div class="glossary-def">Property held for use in production/supply of goods/services, or for administrative purposes.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card cn">
        <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Cost</div><div class="glossary-def">Cash/cash equivalents paid, or the fair value of other consideration given, to acquire an asset at acquisition or construction.</div></div>
        <div class="glossary-item" style="border-bottom:none;"><div class="glossary-term">Carrying amount</div><div class="glossary-def">The amount at which an asset is recognized in the statement of financial position.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card cn">
        <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Current value model</div><div class="glossary-def">Measures all investment property at fair value, with changes recognized in surplus or deficit.</div></div>
        <div class="glossary-item" style="border-bottom:none;"><div class="glossary-term">Historical cost model</div><div class="glossary-def">Measures investment property per IPSAS 43/44/45's historical cost provisions, as applicable.</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="legend">
      <div class="ltitle">Financial statement key</div>
      <div class="lrow">
